docs/handoffs/deepseek-r3-20260906/** -text whitespace=cr-at-eol
docs/handoffs/deepseek-r3-20260906-v2/** -text whitespace=cr-at-eol

# DL-REC-29 (2026-10-08): Record-imported task packages are byte-frozen originals whose
